---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 13px
    actorBkg: "#f8fafc"
    actorBorder: "#64748b"
    actorTextColor: "#1e293b"
    signalColor: "#475569"
    signalTextColor: "#1e293b"
    noteBkgColor: "#fefce8"
    noteBorderColor: "#ca8a04"
    noteTextColor: "#713f12"
    activationBkgColor: "#f0f9ff"
    activationBorderColor: "#0284c7"
    sequenceNumberColor: "#ffffff"
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    messageMargin: 30
    actorMargin: 40
    noteMargin: 8
    useMaxWidth: false
    width: 160
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant D as 🔍 Discover
    participant R as 📚 Research
    participant RF as ✏️ Refine
    participant K as 📦 knowledge.json
    participant S as 📊 state.json

    activate D
    D->>K: + decision: "OAuth2 + PKCE" (user-req)
    D->>K: + assumption: "Postgres only" (unconfirmed)
    D->>K: + open question: "Rate limiting?"
    D->>S: discovery → complete
    D-->>D: writes discovery.md
    deactivate D

    activate R
    R->>K: reads decisions + assumptions
    K-->>R: "OAuth2 + PKCE", "Postgres assumed"
    R->>K: confirm: "Postgres" ✓
    R->>K: + constraint: "next-auth v5 for PKCE"
    R->>S: research → complete
    R-->>R: writes research.md
    deactivate R

    activate RF
    RF->>K: reads all knowledge
    K-->>RF: 1 open question unresolved
    RF->>K: resolve: "Rate limit = 100 req/min"
    RF->>S: refinement → complete
    RF-->>RF: writes refined-spec.md
    deactivate RF

    rect rgb(254, 226, 226)
        Note over RF,R: ⚠️ Gaps found → loop back
        RF->>R: "Research missed token rotation"
        R->>K: + finding: "Token rotation needed"
        R->>S: research → complete (re-run)
    end

    Note over D,S: Pattern continues: Plan → Implement → Review<br/>Same read/write cycle on knowledge.json + state.json
